   "id": "intro",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# STL & Modern C++ (C++11–C++20)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "Topics:\n",
    "1. STL containers: vector, list, map, set, unordered_map\n",
    "2. Iterators and range-based for\n",
    "3. STL algorithms: sort, find, transform, accumulate\n",
    "4. Lambda expressions (C++11)\n",
    "5. Smart pointers: unique_ptr, shared_ptr, weak_ptr (C++11)\n",
    "6. Move semantics and rvalue references\n",
    "7. auto, decltype, structured bindings (C++17)\n",
    "8. std::optional, std::variant (C++17)\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
